    "rangeRipetizioni": "8-15",
    "noteTecniche": "Passo1 Start in a high plank position with your hands slightly wider than shoulder-width apart and your feet together. | Passo2 Abbassa il petto towards the ground, keeping your elbows close to your body. | Passo3 Once il petto is just above the ground, explosively push yourself up, lifting your hands off the ground. | Passo4 As you push up, quickly move your hands out to the sides and slightly forward, allowing your body to drop down towards the ground. | Passo5 Catch yourself with your hands in the wider position and immediately lower il petto towards the ground again. | Passo6 Ripeti the push-up motion, dropping down and catching yourself with your hands in the narrower position. | Passo7 Continue alternating between the wider and narrower hand positions for the desired number of repetitions.",
